2Ki 8:1 , The Shunammite, having left her country seven years, to avoid the forewarned famine, for Elisha's miracle's sake has her land restored by the king;
2Ki 8:7 , Hazael, being sent with a present by Ben-hadad to Elisha at Damascus, after he had heard the prophecy, kills his master, and succeeds him;
2Ki 8:16 , Jehoram's wicked reign in Judah;
2Ki 8:20 , Edom and Libnah revolt;
2Ki 8:23 , Ahaziah succeeds Jehoram;
2Ki 8:25 , Ahaziah's wicked reign;
2Ki 8:28 , He visits Joram, being wounded, at Jezreel.
